    <briefdescription>
<para>Enhanced fuzzy search with Levenshtein, Soundex, and Metaphone algorithms. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_fuzzy_matcher" kindref="compound">FuzzyMatcher</ref> is a thin, algorithm-aware wrapper around SecondaryIndexManager::scanFulltextFuzzy(). It adds:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Phonetic pre-filtering (Soundex / Metaphone) to reduce the candidate set before computing full edit distance.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>N-gram token overlap scoring as a complementary similarity signal.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>A unified, normalized [0,1] similarity score.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Usage</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">FuzzyMatcher::Config<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.algorithm<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_fuzzy_matcher_1ade872a1e213d619ab6d65988306428aaa676541db1e06e88852a9c8cf5b458898" kindref="member">FuzzyMatcher::Algorithm::LEVENSHTEIN</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.max_distance<sp/><sp/>=<sp/>2;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_fuzzy_matcher_1a7db889c624da50c81448f6bea80c2d07" kindref="member">FuzzyMatcher</ref><sp/>matcher(&amp;secondary_index_mgr,<sp/>cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>[status,<sp/>matches]<sp/>=<sp/>matcher.search(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;douments&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;docs&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;body&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread Safety: A single <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_fuzzy_matcher" kindref="compound">FuzzyMatcher</ref> instance is NOT thread-safe. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Exception Safety: <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1search" kindref="compound">search()</ref> never throws; errors are returned via Status. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
